{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/HelloAgainGIF.gif?t=1745609715\" /><strong><br>From the creator of... absolutely nothing else so far...</strong><br>...comes the latest confusing mess of a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Athyra</i> takes the simplest game everyone knows\u2014Rock, Paper, Scissors\u2014and turns it into the most complicated horror experience that not many understand (including maybe the developer).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against unsettling opponents, solve cryptic puzzles, and try not to question your sanity\u2014or the rules. Because yes, there are rules. Probably. Somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also, it\u2019s a horror game.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/RPSGIF.gif?t=1745609715\" /><br><br><strong>In <i>Athyra</i>, you will...</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against twisted, unsettling opponents in the simplest game you've ever known... or thought you knew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover cryptic puzzles and unsettling lore as you venture deeper into the trial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore rooms full of horrors, all linked by a bizarre, unnerving connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Question everything... including the game itself.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645650?t=1745609715","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645650?t=1745609715","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/11069b0eac34c1ea2ef0e73bba2cf9b99ba17e26/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745609715","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/11069b0eac34c1ea2ef0e73bba2cf9b99ba17e26/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745609715","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains the following content that may not be appropriate for all ages:\r\n\r\nViolence: Includes shooting animations and depictions of blood.\r\n\r\nHorror Elements: Contains sudden loud noises, jump scares, and disturbing imagery."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/HelloAgainGIF.gif?t=1745609715\" /><strong><br>From the creator of... absolutely nothing else so far...</strong><br>...comes the latest confusing mess of a game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Athyra</i> takes the simplest game everyone knows\u2014Rock, Paper, Scissors\u2014and turns it into the most complicated horror experience that not many understand (including maybe the developer).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against unsettling opponents, solve cryptic puzzles, and try not to question your sanity\u2014or the rules. Because yes, there are rules. Probably. Somewhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also, it\u2019s a horror game.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645650/extras/RPSGIF.gif?t=1745609715\" /><br><br><strong>In <i>Athyra</i>, you will...</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against twisted, unsettling opponents in the simplest game you've ever known... or thought you knew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover cryptic puzzles and unsettling lore as you venture deeper into the trial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore rooms full of horrors, all linked by a bizarre, unnerving connection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Question everything... including the game itself.</p></li></ul>","develope